From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 04:46:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pwm: samsung: Add the Exynos9820 compatible

The PWM timer block of the Exynos9820 is the 32 bit Samsung PWM timer
with five channels and no external TCLK input, the same block the
Exynos4210 compatible describes.  Add an SoC specific compatible that
falls back to it.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-samsung.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-samsung.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-samsung.yaml
index 97acbdec39f..cf516e681da 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-samsung.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-samsung.yaml
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ properties:
               - samsung,exynos5433-pwm
               - samsung,exynos7-pwm
               - samsung,exynos8890-pwm
+              - samsung,exynos9820-pwm
               - samsung,exynosautov9-pwm
               - samsung,exynosautov920-pwm
               - tesla,fsd-pwm
-- 
2.53.0.windows.1

